{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/766495-looking-for-play-by-post-groups","id":766495,"title":"Looking for Play by Post groups","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-15T13:23:33-08:00","id":766495,"title":"Looking for Play by Post groups","content":"Well, pretty much everythings in the title. I live in Germany, if thats of any importance, but I'm proficient enough in English, so thats not a problem. Games I'm willing to play are: <br /> -Scion <br /> -Vampire (both Masquerade and Requiem)<br /> -Werewolf<br /> -Mummy<br /> -Changeling<br /> -Beast (never played that one, so I'd need some help there)<br /> -Pretty much anything else if you've got the patience to walk me through it <br /> <br /> I'm looking for a semi-serious group who is up for a good plot but likes to have a laugh or two along the way as well. No angsty cool characters for me or at least not primarily. I like weird, quirky ones better. Still, a dark plot can enchant me as long as theres some room for at least dark humor. If that sounds like a guy you'd like to have with you, contact me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8325-asmael","name":"Asmael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-16T04:27:26-08:00","id":766985,"title":"","content":"I'd love to start a Play-by-Post 1e Vampire: The Requiem/Changeling: The Lost crossover game if you are interested.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"C